@host = http://localhost:8080
@access_token_a = <user A — owner>
@access_token_outsider = <не в комнате>
@room_id = <room с двумя members>

### Member видит список → 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_a}}

# Status 200
# Body: {"items":[{"userId":"...","role":"owner","joinedAt":"..."},{"userId":"...","role":"member","joinedAt":"..."}]}

### Outsider → 403 ROOM-003
GET {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_outsider}}

# Status 403
# Body: {"error":{"code":"ROOM-003","message":"not a member"}}
